      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "7/26/25: @TxDPS K-9 Bona and her handler once again demonstrated their relentless determination, tracking more than two miles in Maverick County to assist @USBPChiefDRT Agents, with air support from @CBPAMO.\n\nThis joint effort led to the successful apprehension of two illegal immigrants attempting to evade capture by crossing through private ranches.\n\nWhether it’s one or many, every apprehension helps secure our communities and nation—disrupting potential gotaways and reinforcing border safety.\n\nThis is just one example of the continued state and federal collaboration under Operation Lone Star.\n\nThe mission continues.\n\n#OperationLoneStar #BorderSecurity #TexasDPS #K9Bona #Teamwork #PublicSafety",
